n  the tradition of Howard the tradition of  activism the tradition of resistance to  oppression and the university should  recognize that now some alumni from that  1968 protest have come here to help the  students with their sit-in but the  Alumni Association for the University  says it supports the president and  rejects all calls for his resignation  Fionna stirred a lot of controversy  there Jam thank you
 

